README FILE

The files here are in the "extended format"
and they need to be converted to the "basic format".

First use fileProcessor to clean each file (getting rid of white spaces
and comments).  The clean file will be named "output-tmp.txt".
Then call the input_interpreter to convert "output-tmp.txt" to
the file "output-tmp-py.txt".  You can now rename it back to
original-first-name.ext.

Files with last name "ext" is in extended format.
When converted to basic format. change the last name to "txt".




